<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">tatakau koto mo aishi au koto mo</font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">In fighting and in love.</font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">owari wa shinai</font></b></font></font>

26
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">To the distant light above,</font></b></font></font>

27
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">ON THE WAY</font></b></font></font>

28
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">yes, we are on the way!</font></b></font></font>

29
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I WANNA ROCKS mune ni ROCKS</font></b></font></font>

30
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:28,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

31
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to think when using Jutsu.</font>

32
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They can be used against you.</font>

33
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, don't get caught
in an obvious trap, you fool.</font>

34
00:01:45,910 --> 00:01:48,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja must see
through deception... got it?</font>

35
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that!</font>

36
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:55,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, you say that because
you don't get it. Listen up.</font>

37
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your movements are wasteful.</font>

38
00:02:00,390 --> 00:02:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now!</font>

39
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He finally dropped his guard!</font>

40
00:02:07,190 --> 00:02:08,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so...</font>

41
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

42
00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk, Sasuke! You overdid it.</font>

43
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Another substitution...?</font>

44
00:02:29,790 --> 00:02:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must have found out my location
with those Shuriken!</font>

45
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He purposely lowered his guard!
Serves me right...</font>

46
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I fell for the trap.</font>

47
00:02:39,260 --> 00:02:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he's over there, eh...</font>

48
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Where are you...?!</font>

49
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me,
Kakashi-sensei already...</font>

50
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

51
00:02:50,100 --> 00:02:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That couldn't happen to Sasuke-kun, right?!</font>

52
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Safe! He didn't notice me.</font>

53
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, behind you.</font>

54
00:02:59,610 --> 00:03:00,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

55
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with that "A Ninja must see
through deception" stuff?!</font>

56
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:13,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! I'll never fall for his trap again!</font>

57
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:22,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I fell for it again!</font>

58
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:28,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Fail?</font>

59
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:28,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Kakashi's conclusion</font>

60
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?! Huh?!</font>

61
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:53,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on! Where's Sensei?!</font>

62
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! What's going on?!</font>

63
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! What's what?!</font>

64
00:03:58,090 --> 00:04:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

65
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:00,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?!</font>

66
00:04:01,250 --> 00:04:03,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sa... Saku... Ra...</font>

67
00:04:04,090 --> 00:04:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Please... help... me...</font>

68
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I went a bit overboard...</font>

69
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's really something
she should notice...</font>

70
00:04:24,490 --> 00:04:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was that voice... Sakura's...?</font>

71
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi Battle Skill #2, Genjutsu.</font>

72
00:04:31,450 --> 00:04:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura was easily lured.</font>

73
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu, huh...?</font>

74
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:40,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An illusory mind-controlling technique.
I'm not surprised she got lured.</font>

75
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

76
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm different from them.</font>

77
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you say that after
you get a bell... Sasuke-kun?</font>

78
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use just using
straightforward attacks.</font>

79
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A trap?!</font>

80
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

81
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:45,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's...?!</font>

82
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a guy.</font>

83
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time
to read "Make-Out Paradise."</font>

84
00:06:01,290 --> 00:06:03,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?
I...?!</font>

85
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:10,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! I saw Sasuke-kun on
the verge of dying and I...</font>

86
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:14,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!
Don't die and leave me here!!</font>

87
00:06:14,850 --> 00:06:16,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you?!</font>

88
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's what it looks like
behind the logs.</font>

89
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:33,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! There are box lunches on the stone!</font>

90
00:06:34,790 --> 00:06:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja must see through deception... eh?</font>

91
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! I'll acknowledge that
you're different from those two.</font>

92
00:06:48,930 --> 00:06:49,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Horse!</font>

93
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tiger!</font>

94
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style! Fireball Jutsu!</font>

95
00:06:54,930 --> 00:06:57,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! That's not a Jutsu
that a Genin can do...</font>

96
00:06:58,430 --> 00:07:00,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He shouldn't have
enough Chakra yet!</font>

97
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gone!
Is he behind me?! No, above me?!</font>

98
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is he?!</font>

99
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:21,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm under you!!</font>

100
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:25,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

101
00:07:25,670 --> 00:07:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style: Headhunter Jutsu.</font>

102
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:39,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi Battle Skill #3, Ninjutsu.</font>

103
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:42,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that? You can't move, heh?</font>

104
00:07:44,610 --> 00:07:49,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although, you're... already starting
to make your mark.</font>

105
00:07:50,650 --> 00:07:51,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, oh well.</font>

106
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They do say that the nail that sticks up
gets hammered down, so...</font>

107
00:07:58,290 --> 00:07:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

108
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:08,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have to naively take those bells.
I'll just eat in secret right now!</font>

109
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:10,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat!!</font>

110
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey.</font>

111
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just joking...</font>

112
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too late!</font>

113
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...! Is there this much of
a difference in strength...?</font>

114
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:32,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

115
00:08:35,070 --> 00:08:37,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's a freshly severed head?!</font>

116
00:08:41,450 --> 00:08:43,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with her?</font>

117
00:08:52,590 --> 00:08:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?</font>

118
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're okay!</font>

119
00:08:55,180 --> 00:08:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, cut it out!
Don't cling to me!</font>

120
00:09:01,220 --> 00:09:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not much time left until noon.
I'm going.</font>

121
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:08,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, you're still going
after the bells?!</font>

122
00:09:09,070 --> 00:09:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was able to touch them last time.
Next time I'll be able to take them.</font>

123
00:09:12,150 --> 00:09:14,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!
I-I see.</font>

124
00:09:15,070 --> 00:09:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough,
you're awesome, Sasuke-kun.</font>

125
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:21,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way I can take
the bells from Sensei.</font>

126
00:09:22,410 --> 00:09:26,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, I'll face
separation from Sasuke-kun...</font>

127
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:31,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... say. There's really no time left...</font>

128
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:35,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So let's just take it easy and
try again next time.</font>

129
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:02,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the only one
who can kill that man.</font>

130
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:11,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? What?
You mean Sensei?</font>

131
00:10:12,460 --> 00:10:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time... I was crying.</font>

132
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crying...?</font>

133
00:10:19,390 --> 00:10:20,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My...</font>

134
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? What is it...?</font>

135
00:10:25,350 --> 00:10:29,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm an avenger. I must become stronger
than that man...</font>

136
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have time for setbacks here...</font>

137
00:10:36,820 --> 00:10:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">... to kill a certain man!</font>

138
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... I wasted my time talking.</font>

139
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

140
00:10:58,050 --> 00:11:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh-oh, your stomachs are growling...</font>

141
00:11:02,550 --> 00:11:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, about this exercise...</font>

142
00:11:05,850 --> 00:11:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! There's no need for you guys
to go back to the Academy.</font>

143
00:11:12,350 --> 00:11:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? I... All I did was lay unconscious.</font>

144
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that okay?</font>

145
00:11:18,530 --> 00:11:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love is victorious!! Shannaro!!</font>

146
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo!</font>

147
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:27,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, then!
That means the three of us...</font>

148
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. The three of you...</font>

149
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">must quit being Ninja!!</font>

150
00:11:43,430 --> 00:11:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way!</font>

151
00:11:45,850 --> 00:11:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi hasn't passed
a single person this whole time...</font>

152
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka...</font>

153
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I don't know if it's good for
those kids to become Shinobi right away...</font>

154
00:11:58,690 --> 00:12:02,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...
Kakashi's judgments were correct...</font>

155
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit being Ninja?! What do you mean?!</font>

156
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, well it's true, we weren't able to
take the bells.</font>

157
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why do we have to be told to "quit"?!</font>

158
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because you're all squirts who
don't have the qualifications to become Ninja.</font>

159
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

160
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

161
00:12:25,930 --> 00:12:27,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying you're squirts.</font>

162
00:12:29,430 --> 00:12:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't step on Sasuke-kun!!</font>

163
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:39,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you kids thinking that
being a Ninja is easy? Huh?</font>

164
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you think you're doing
this exercise in teams?</font>

165
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! What do you mean?</font>

166
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Put simply...</font>

167
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's as if you guys have no
understanding of the answer to this test.</font>

168
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Answer...?</font>

169
00:12:58,460 --> 00:13:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. The answer that determines
passing or failing of this test.</font>

170
00:13:03,010 --> 00:13:06,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... what I've wanted to ask
about for a while now.</font>

171
00:13:07,470 --> 00:13:10,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, are you guys brainless or what?</font>

172
00:13:11,770 --> 00:13:14,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you get the meaning of
the three-man team?!</font>

173
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:19,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez!! What of three people to a team?!</font>

174
00:13:20,110 --> 00:13:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... teamwork!</font>

175
00:13:24,070 --> 00:13:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean, working together?</font>

176
00:13:26,530 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Exactly. But it's too late even
if you realize that now.</font>

177
00:13:30,990 --> 00:13:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might've been able to...</font>

178
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take the bells if the three of you
had come at me...</font>

179
00:13:35,290 --> 00:13:37,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's too bad.</font>

180
00:13:38,130 --> 00:13:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now wait a minute.</font>

181
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:42,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why use teamwork if
there were only two bells?</font>

182
00:13:43,010 --> 00:13:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the three of us were to desperately go
take the bells with one having to hold back,</font>

183
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that wouldn't be teamwork.
That'd create internal discord.</font>

184
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course!</font>

185
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a test set up to purposely
place you against each other.</font>

186
00:13:56,770 --> 00:14:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's under just such conditions
where one's own interests aren't the issue.</font>

187
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The intention was to select those
who could prioritize teamwork...</font>

188
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite this, you fools...</font>

189
00:14:08,740 --> 00:14:09,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

190
00:14:10,370 --> 00:14:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were only concerned with Sasuke and
you didn't even know where he was.</font>

191
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you didn't care for Naruto who was
right in front of your eyes...</font>

192
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

193
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All you do is run solo...</font>

194
00:14:23,170 --> 00:14:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You labeled the other two as hindrances
and acted on your own...</font>

195
00:14:28,010 --> 00:14:29,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Missions are carried out in teams!</font>

196
00:14:30,180 --> 00:14:33,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistaking that Ninja need
unsurpassed individual skills...</font>

197
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:37,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But "teamwork" is considered
more important than that.</font>

198
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:43,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Individual actions that disrupt teamwork
throw the team into crisis and lead to death...</font>

199
00:14:44,190 --> 00:14:45,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example...</font>

200
00:14:46,570 --> 00:14:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Sakura! Kill Naruto, or else Sasuke dies..."</font>

201
00:14:51,490 --> 00:14:53,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! What?! What?!</font>

202
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is what will... happen.</font>

203
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I was so surprised.</font>

204
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of having a hostage taken,</font>

205
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:07,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're faced with two impossible choices
and end up being killed.</font>

206
00:15:09,130 --> 00:15:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every mission is
a life-risking assignment.</font>

207
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:16,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at this...</font>

208
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:19,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The many names engraved
on this stone...</font>

209
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:24,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are all Ninja who are called
heroes in the village.</font>

210
00:15:26,070 --> 00:15:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That, that, that, that! I like that!</font>

211
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've decided now to get
my name engraved there, too!</font>

212
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A hero! A hero!
I'm not going to die like a dog!</font>

213
00:15:38,910 --> 00:15:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... they're not just ordinary heroes.</font>

214
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No kidding. Then, what kind
of heroes are they?</font>

215
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey!</font>

216
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:52,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are heroes
who were killed in action.</font>

217
00:15:53,430 --> 00:15:54,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Killed in action?</font>

218
00:15:55,350 --> 00:15:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It means they died
performing a mission.</font>

219
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a memorial.</font>

220
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:12,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The names of my friends
are also engraved here...</font>

221
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you guys one more chance!</font>

222
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, after noon it'll be
a harsher battle to take the bell.</font>

223
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who want to take on
the challenge can eat lunch.</font>

224
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, don't let Naruto have any.</font>

225
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:43,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's punishment for breaking the rules and
attempting to eat lunch on your own.</font>

226
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone lets him eat...</font>

227
00:16:47,230 --> 00:16:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that person will be disqualified
on the spot.</font>

228
00:16:53,950 --> 00:16:57,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I make the rules, here. Got it?!</font>

229
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must be going.</font>

230
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:02,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen to me, Iruka.</font>

231
00:17:03,870 --> 00:17:04,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

232
00:17:05,210 --> 00:17:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what the result,
don't hold it against Kakashi...</font>

233
00:17:11,510 --> 00:17:12,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alright.</font>

234
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay with not eating lunch!
No sweat at all!</font>

235
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No sweat...</font>

236
00:17:40,370 --> 00:17:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

237
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, Sasuke-kun.
Sensei just said...!</font>

238
00:17:47,710 --> 00:17:51,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay.
There's no sign of him now.</font>

239
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of us are going to go
take the bells together.</font>

240
00:17:54,630 --> 00:17:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be trouble for me
if he becomes a hindrance, so...</font>

241
00:17:59,090 --> 00:17:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

242
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

243
00:18:20,450 --> 00:18:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks...</font>

244
00:18:22,410 --> 00:18:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't thank me.
Just hurry up and eat.</font>

245
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

246
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm on... a diet...
I mean I just eat less than Sasuke-kun.</font>

247
00:18:31,790 --> 00:18:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you don't need to worry.</font>

248
00:18:33,960 --> 00:18:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

249
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See...</font>

250
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

251
00:18:39,470 --> 00:18:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry it up.
We don't know when he'll be back...</font>

252
00:18:43,220 --> 00:18:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just this one time.</font>

253
00:18:44,970 --> 00:18:47,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay? You got it?!</font>

254
00:18:48,310 --> 00:18:50,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it.</font>

255
00:18:59,070 --> 00:19:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You three!</font>

256
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

257
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You defied the rules so that
means you know what's coming...</font>

258
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have... something to say?</font>

259
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you see...</font>

260
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:25,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

261
00:19:25,850 --> 00:19:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But! But! But!
You said, Sensei!</font>

262
00:19:29,940 --> 00:19:31,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys...</font>

263
00:19:31,770 --> 00:19:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're a three-man team, right?</font>

264
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!
The three of us are one, so...!</font>

265
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! That's right!
That's right!</font>

266
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

267
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The three of you are one, eh...</font>

268
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You pass!</font>

269
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:57,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

270
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

271
00:20:01,170 --> 00:20:02,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You pass!</font>

272
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:06,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We passed?! Why?!</font>

273
00:20:07,890 --> 00:20:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are the first.</font>

274
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up until now, it was always just dunces
who would meekly listen to what I said.</font>

275
00:20:16,730 --> 00:20:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja must see through deception...</font>

276
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the world of Ninja,</font>

277
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those who break rules and codes
are branded as garbage...</font>

278
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

279
00:20:27,370 --> 00:20:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who don't cherish their friends are
garbage worse than that.</font>

280
00:20:37,710 --> 00:20:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's... He's... kinda... cool...</font>

281
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it for the exercise...</font>

282
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone passes!</font>

283
00:20:46,390 --> 00:20:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Team 7 starts their mission
tomorrow!</font>

284
00:20:49,970 --> 00:20:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

285
00:20:53,850 --> 00:20:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!! I'm a Ninja!
Ninja! Ninja!</font>

286
00:20:58,900 --> 00:20:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go home.</font>

287
00:21:05,410 --> 00:21:06,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

288
00:21:08,490 --> 00:21:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

289
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">knew this is how it'd turn out!</font>

290
00:21:15,330 --> 00:21:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Untie the rope!</font>

291
00:21:33,410 --> 00:21:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

292
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

293
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

294
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

296
00:21:53,850 --> 00:21:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:21:57,190 --> 00:22:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:22:00,650 --> 00:22:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

299
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:07,320
